{"nodes": [{"id": "index_thaira", "label": "Thaira \u2014 RPG isom\u00e9trico (shell da aplica\u00e7\u00e3o)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:1-619", "rationale": "P\u00e1gina \u00fanica em pt-BR que carrega todo o jogo por tags <script> em ordem fixa (audio, data, art, world, render2d, game, ui, hud); nenhum bundler, nenhum m\u00f3dulo ES.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_dock_layout", "label": "Esqueleto de docks (sidebar | jogo | sidebar)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:22-33", "rationale": "Layout copiado do modelo do cliente de MMO: duas sidebars flex de largura fixa (--dock:208px) com setas para colapsar (.dock.vazio zera a largura) e a coluna central ocupando o resto.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_panel_system", "label": "Pain\u00e9is colaps\u00e1veis das sidebars", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:36-47", "rationale": "Cada painel tem cabe\u00e7alho (.ph) clic\u00e1vel e corpo (.pb); a classe .fechado esconde o corpo e arredonda o cabe\u00e7alho, ent\u00e3o o estado de colapso \u00e9 puramente CSS.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_statusbars", "label": "Barras de status (HP/MP/XP e buffs)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:49-65", "rationale": "Um bloco #statusbars s\u00f3, que vive tanto na borda do jogo (#topbar, em linha) quanto dentro de um painel da sidebar (em coluna) \u2014 o CSS troca a dire\u00e7\u00e3o pelo pai, evitando duplicar a marca\u00e7\u00e3o.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_stage_canvas", "label": "#stage / canvas #c (\u00e1rea do jogo)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:67-74", "rationale": "Canvas ocupando todo o palco com vinheta radial por ::after e um #overlay sem pointer-events por cima para nameplates e texto flutuante em DOM em vez de canvas.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_pixelated_rendering", "label": "image-rendering:pixelated no canvas", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:71-73", "rationale": "DPR fracion\u00e1rio (Windows a 125%) n\u00e3o vira escala inteira, ent\u00e3o sobra uma esticada do navegador; pixelated mant\u00e9m essa esticada dura em vez de borrar o desenho.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_plate_overlay", "label": "Nameplates e texto flutuante (.plate/.ftext)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:74-85", "rationale": "Elementos posicionados em 0,0 e movidos por transform; cada plate carrega nome, bal\u00e3o de fala (.say) e barra de vida (.pb), ent\u00e3o o render 2D s\u00f3 precisa publicar coordenadas.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_toast", "label": "Toasts de marco (n\u00edvel, per\u00edcia, besti\u00e1rio, \u00e1rea)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:93-106", "rationale": "Notifica\u00e7\u00e3o puramente CSS: anima\u00e7\u00e3o toastIn + toastOut com delay de 2.6s dispara a sa\u00edda sozinha, sem timer em JS.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_stance_system", "label": "Postura de combate (defesa/equil\u00edbrio/ataque)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:108-121", "rationale": "Tr\u00eas bot\u00f5es data-s=def|bal|atk trocando defesa por dano: defesa quase n\u00e3o machuca mas aguenta, ataque d\u00e1 dano cheio com defesa fraca.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_hotbar", "label": "Barra de habilidades (#hotbar / .hk)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:122-135", "rationale": "Slots F1\u2013F12 (tamb\u00e9m 1\u20139 e 0) com estados visuais .nomana e .vazio; slot vazio abre o seletor (#pick-win) e bot\u00e3o direito limpa. O <u> no fim da c\u00e9lula \u00e9 a m\u00e1scara de cooldown.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_console_chat", "label": "Console de log e chat com abas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:137-157", "rationale": "Console redimension\u00e1vel por grip ns-resize; o input de chat \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m a linha de conjura\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 digitar as palavras (exura, exori vis) lan\u00e7a a magia, sem comando separado.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_combat_log_channels", "label": "Canais do log de combate por classe CSS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:147-154", "rationale": "Uma cor por tipo de informa\u00e7\u00e3o (dano, apanha, cura, mana, morte) para o olho separar sem ler. A classe `cbt` \u00e9 a que marca a linha como combate e decide o que a aba mostra; a cor fica por conta da segunda classe. O filtro da aba \u00e9 um seletor CSS em #log[data-canal=combate], n\u00e3o filtragem em JS.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_minimap", "label": "Minimapa com r\u00f3tulo de andar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:162-164", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_equip_slots", "label": "Slots de equipamento e mochila", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:168-190", "rationale": "Bonec\u00e3o de equipamento com c\u00e9lulas absolutas de 56px sobre uma \u00e1rea fixa 178x239, e mochila em grid fluido de 5 colunas com aspect-ratio 1.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_icon_scaling", "label": "Escala dos \u00edcones (.ii) por contexto", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:178-188", "rationale": "Em linhas de texto (loja, besti\u00e1rio) o \u00edcone escala pelo font-size do container; na c\u00e9lula n\u00e3o, porque a mochila \u00e9 grid fluido (1fr) e encolhe at\u00e9 ~31px, ent\u00e3o o \u00edcone acompanha a c\u00e9lula (76%, j\u00e1 que os PNG trazem folga pr\u00f3pria) e n\u00e3o a fonte, sen\u00e3o transborda. Nos slots de equipamento h\u00e1 um corner-cut marcado `ponytail:`: 42px fixos evitam a redu\u00e7\u00e3o fracionada de slots de 56px, com upgrade para medida proporcional inteira se o grid mudar.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_win_flex_column", "label": "Janelas como coluna flex centralizada", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:217-232", "rationale": "Janela \u00e9 coluna: cabe\u00e7alho fixo em cima, corpo rolando embaixo. O JS abre com display:flex \u2014 abrir com block matava o flex e as listas longas ficavam cortadas, porque min-height:0 + overflow:auto no filho s\u00f3 valem dentro de um pai flex. Cada janela s\u00f3 declara tamanho, nunca posi\u00e7\u00e3o: a centraliza\u00e7\u00e3o vem de top/left 50% + translate(-50%,-50%).", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_loot_win", "label": "Janela de saque (#loot-win)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:477-481", "rationale": "Grid de 5 colunas com bot\u00e3o \"Pegar tudo\"; abre ao clicar no corpo, e F ao lado do corpo pega tudo sem abrir.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_shop_win", "label": "Loja do Templo (#shop-win)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:483-489", "rationale": "Duas colunas fixas comprar/vender; o bot\u00e3o #shop-btn fica escondido por padr\u00e3o e s\u00f3 aparece quando o jogador est\u00e1 no templo.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_best_win", "label": "Besti\u00e1rio (#best-win)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:244-267", "rationale": "Lista em grid auto-fill + painel de detalhe fixo de 300px; cartas .locked ficam em grayscale com opacidade baixa, ent\u00e3o a progress\u00e3o de descoberta \u00e9 vis\u00edvel sem esconder a entrada.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_map_win", "label": "Mapa expandido (#map-win)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:499-508", "rationale": "Quatro abas de andar (Montanha z=0, Superf\u00edcie z=1, Caverna z=2, Abismo z=3) sobre um canvas arrast\u00e1vel; a legenda define c\u00edrculos laranja como hunts, amarelo sobe de andar e escuro desce.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_pick_win", "label": "Seletor de slot (#pick-win)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:510-513", "rationale": "Janela gen\u00e9rica de escolha usada tanto pelo slot vazio da hotbar quanto pelos slots de equipamento.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_ui_win", "label": "Janela Interface (#ui-win)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:281-292", "rationale": "Liga, desliga e troca de lado cada painel, e traz as linhas de volume (.ui-vol) com slider; \u00e9 o painel de configura\u00e7\u00e3o do jogo, sem tela de op\u00e7\u00f5es separada.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_tooltip", "label": "Tooltip global (#tooltip)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:293-297", "rationale": "Um \u00fanico elemento fixed, largura travada em 236px e pointer-events:none, reaproveitado por itens, magias e monstros em vez de um tooltip por componente.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_menu_screen", "label": "Tela de sele\u00e7\u00e3o de personagens (#menu-screen)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:522-536", "rationale": "Primeira tela do fluxo de entrada: lista de personagens salvos em cartas selecion\u00e1veis, com \"Entrar no mundo\" desabilitado at\u00e9 haver sele\u00e7\u00e3o.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_create_screen", "label": "Tela de cria\u00e7\u00e3o de personagem (#create-screen)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:538-571", "rationale": "Segunda etapa do fluxo: nome (m\u00e1x. 16 caracteres) e voca\u00e7\u00e3o. A decis\u00e3o de voca\u00e7\u00e3o define como se joga, por isso ganha carrossel dedicado em vez de um <select>.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_voc_carousel", "label": "Carrossel de voca\u00e7\u00f5es", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:341-355", "rationale": "Quatro voca\u00e7\u00f5es navegadas por setas, cada uma exibindo \u00edcone, descri\u00e7\u00e3o e quatro n\u00fameros compar\u00e1veis (vida/n\u00edvel, mana/n\u00edvel, regenera\u00e7\u00e3o de vida e de mana) para a escolha ser informada.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_death_screen", "label": "Tela de morte (#death-screen)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:573-579", "rationale": "Penalidade de morte \u00e9 10% da experi\u00eancia e renascimento no templo \u2014 sem perda de itens, o que mant\u00e9m a puni\u00e7\u00e3o leg\u00edvel e revers\u00edvel.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_help_screen", "label": "Tela de ajuda / comandos (#help)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:581-608", "rationale": "Refer\u00eancia de teclas: WASD/setas andam passo a passo, clique move ou ataca, F1\u2013F12 s\u00e3o habilidades, Ctrl+R recarrega (porque F5 virou o slot 5 da barra), X/C bebem po\u00e7\u00e3o, Q/E giram a c\u00e2mera, M/B abrem mapa e besti\u00e1rio.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_progressao_por_distancia", "label": "Dificuldade por dist\u00e2ncia e profundidade", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:601-602", "rationale": "Quanto mais longe do templo e mais fundo na caverna, mais forte o monstro e melhor o loot; escadas douradas sobem, buracos escuros descem. A curva de dificuldade \u00e9 geogr\u00e1fica, n\u00e3o por n\u00edvel de zona. O jogo salva sozinho a cada 15s.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_creditos_3d", "label": "Cr\u00e9ditos de modelos 3D (Kenney Nature Kit, Quaternius Ultimate Monsters)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:603-605", "rationale": "Modelos 3D em dom\u00ednio p\u00fablico (CC0): cen\u00e1rio do Nature Kit da Kenney e criaturas do Ultimate Monsters do Quaternius. Terreno, efeitos, sons e os monstros sem modelo s\u00e3o gerados por c\u00f3digo \u2014 a mesma pol\u00edtica CC0 do \u00e1udio.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_script_load_order", "label": "Ordem fixa de carregamento dos scripts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:610-617", "rationale": "Oito <script> cl\u00e1ssicos em ordem de depend\u00eancia (audio, data, art, world, render2d, game, ui, hud), compartilhando globais em vez de m\u00f3dulos ES ou bundler \u2014 abrir o index.html direto do disco j\u00e1 roda o jogo.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "index_creditos_3d", "target": "assets_creditos_politica_cc0", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:603-605", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_creditos_3d", "target": "assets_creditos_kenney", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:603-604", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_thaira", "target": "index_script_load_order", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:610-617", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_thaira", "target": "index_dock_layout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:395-475", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_dock_layout", "target": "index_panel_system", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:445-473", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_ui_win", "target": "index_panel_system", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:598", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_ui_win", "target": "index_dock_layout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:598", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_statusbars", "target": "index_panel_system", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:49-53", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_pixelated_rendering", "target": "index_stage_canvas", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:71-73", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_pixelated_rendering", "target": "index_minimap", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:162", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_stage_canvas", "target": "index_plate_overlay", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:410-413", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_stage_canvas", "target": "index_toast", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:410-413", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_combat_log_channels", "target": "index_console_chat", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:147-154", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_icon_scaling", "target": "index_equip_slots", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "index.html:178-188", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_icon_scaling", "target": "index_hotbar", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_fil